    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> The speeding projectile wrecks your hand, smashing both metacarpal and carpal bones, ripping apart tendons and nerves. Any potential career with the violin ends here and now…</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2). You suffer a Broken Bone (Major), except any Tests for long-term penalties automatically fail. Also, you permanently lose function in 1d10/5 plus one fingers (see under Amputated Parts).</p>"
